\begin_layout Standard
The budget binds because adding one dollar to the safe asset raises consumption in both states. Hence 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha+\beta=24$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\lambda>0$
\end_inset

 at the solution.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection*
Step 3: make an active-set guess
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Guess that both assets are held: 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha>0$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\beta>0$
\end_inset

. Complementarity then gives 
\begin_inset Formula \[
F_{\alpha}=F_{\beta}=\lambda,
\; \alpha+\beta=24.
\]
\end_inset

The guess will not be accepted until every sign is checked.
\end_layout

