\begin_layout Section
A static laboratory for three regimes
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
A household chooses parental consumption 
\begin_inset Formula $c$
\end_inset

, a divisible fertility index 
\begin_inset Formula $n\ge0$
\end_inset

, and total human-capital investment 
\begin_inset Formula $H$
\end_inset

