\begin_inset Formula $n>0$
\end_inset

, define quality per child by 
\begin_inset Formula $q=H/n$
\end_inset

. Preferences are 
\begin_inset Formula \[
U(c,n,H)=c+6n-\frac12n^2+4H-\frac12H^2.
\]
\end_inset

The constraints are 
\begin_inset Formula \[
c+pn+kH+\frac12H^2\le y,
\; c\ge1,
\; sn\le H\le4n.
